2\. Citation integrity — every cited paper\_id is one of: \`2107.14691\`, \`2109.06896\`, \`2403.01365\`, \`doi-10-1093-jcmc-zmac001\`, \`doi-10-1145-1056808-1057071\`, \`doi-10-1145-1557019-1557124\`, \`doi-10-1145-2063576-2063683\`, \`doi-10-1145-290941-291025\`, \`doi-10-1207-s15327051hci2001-2-3\`, \`doi-10-18653-v1-2007-sigdial-1-4\`, \`doi-10-18653-v1-d19-1386\`, \`manual-13a21477e7\`, \`manual-c2f56a571b\`.
